{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28112","headline":"哭饶州吴谏议使君 · 雍陶","name":"哭饶州吴谏议使君","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"忽闻身谢满朝惊，俄感鄱阳罢市情。\n遗爱永存今似古，高名不朽死如生。\n神仙难见青骡事，谏议空留白马名。\n授馆曾爲门下客，几回垂泪过宣平。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"雍陶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_28112.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28112","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}